{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 2116 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "6aa10d038e3449acd0aff8bb13aa0fbce2db51e91037662881e22336ab140002" :edb/db-before-t 2115 :edb/db-after-t 2116 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535428 50 #inst "2026-10-08T23:52:02.604Z" 13194139535428 true] [17592186059661 1020 #edb/ref 17592186348670 13194139535428 true] [17592186059662 1020 #edb/ref 17592186348678 13194139535428 true] [17592186060115 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535428 true] [17592186060115 1100 "> A calculator is required to answer this question.\n\nLet $\\mathbf{a} = \\langle  2 x , 1 , 4 \\rangle  ,$, $\\mathbf{b} = \\langle  2 , 0 , 3 \\rangle$ and $| \\, \\mathbf{a} \\times  \\mathbf{b} \\, | = \\sqrt{13} .$. Find $x$." 13194139535428 false] [17592186060115 1100 "Let $a=⟨2x,1,4⟩,$ $b=⟨2,0,3⟩$ and $|\\,a\\times b\\,|=\\sqrt{13}.$ Find $x.$" 13194139535428 true] [17592186060115 1145 "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2x & 1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}2x & 4 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}2x & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(3-0)i-(6x-8)j+(0-2)k \\\\  & =⟨3,-(6x-8),-2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, computing the magnitude, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+(-(6x-8))^{2}+(-2)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+36{x}^{2}-96x+64+4} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{36{x}^{2}-96x+77}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLastly, we solve for $x$ the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{13} \\\\ \\sqrt{36{x}^{2}-96x+77} & =\\sqrt{13} \\\\ 36{x}^{2}-96x+77 & =13 \\\\ 36{x}^{2}-96x+64 & =0 \\\\ 9{x}^{2}-24x+16 & =0 \\\\ (3x-4)^{2} & =0 \\\\ 3x-4 & =0 \\\\ x & =\\frac{4}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=\\frac{4}{3}.$" 13194139535428 true] [17592186303495 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348677 13194139535428 true] [17592186348670 1017 #edb/ref 17592186348671 13194139535428 true] [17592186348670 1089 "q-1406" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348670 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535428 true] [17592186348670 1100 "Let $u=3i-2k$ and $v=-2i+j+5k.$ Determine $u\\times v.$" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348670 1113 #uuid "427de437-0817-5025-a19d-93d24fc75213" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348670 1145 "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 3 & 0 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 5\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(0\\cdot 5-(-2)\\cdot 1)i-(3\\cdot 5-(-2)\\cdot (-2))j+(3\\cdot 1-0\\cdot (-2))k \\\\  & =(0+2)i-(15-4)j+(3-0)k \\\\  & =2i-11j+3k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348672 13194139535428 true] [17592186348671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348673 13194139535428 true] [17592186348671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348674 13194139535428 true] [17592186348671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348675 13194139535428 true] [17592186348671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348676 13194139535428 true] [17592186348671 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535428 true] [17592186348671 1041 "selection" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348671 1104 #edb/ref 17592186348673 13194139535428 true] [17592186348671 1110 #uuid "0fc2bd0f-4423-520e-978d-b504a808bdde" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348672 1034 "2i-11k" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348672 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535428 true] [17592186348672 1111 #uuid "bc1295d6-b73a-54af-993e-65d79d4f7be8" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348673 1034 "2i-11j+3k" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348673 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535428 true] [17592186348673 1111 #uuid "f45aa475-1f0d-5466-a280-d5f4515a6c07" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348674 1034 "2i+3k" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348674 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535428 true] [17592186348674 1111 #uuid "87f4a9da-d670-5548-8de3-3