 {x}^{2}-10x+24 & =0 \\\\ (x-4)(x-6) & =0 \\\\ x & =4,\\,x=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, in ascending order, the solutions are $x=4,$ $x=6.$" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348679 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348680 13194139535428 true] [17592186348679 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535428 true] [17592186348679 1041 "field-1" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348679 1104 #edb/ref 17592186348680 13194139535428 true] [17592186348679 1110 #uuid "e6c65aa6-e71f-5d1a-9f30-d21c749bb924" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348680 1034 "4" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348680 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535428 true] [17592186348680 1111 #uuid "175571ef-5a37-57f7-8fef-095de8fcfbaa" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348681 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348682 13194139535428 true] [17592186348681 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535428 true] [17592186348681 1041 "field-2" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348681 1104 #edb/ref 17592186348682 13194139535428 true] [17592186348681 1110 #uuid "0aa99fc5-7859-59c5-a94a-5a4598cca902" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348682 1034 "6" 13194139535428 true] [17592186348682 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535428 true] [17592186348682 1111 #uuid "294c6f86-d2d4-5dfb-ad67-518e235aa1d5" 13194139535428 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-1406" 17592186348670 "q-1406/selection" 17592186348671 "q-1406/selection/3f09183fbd1f054309e7cd69aa3f7d653fbf3c1dae6f39dd88e49429f534f443" 17592186348672 "q-1406/selection/6a10aed75783a1548ed61e712be1da722efc3de936946cd5e34ab166deb08f0b" 17592186348673 "q-1406/selection/71f931079bd813b9f19ffde7b26d6e00d85c6cb414795c3d34d709787474ae0a" 17592186348674 "q-1406/selection/b24dde319d5f4b0d6fb2ac7f4921e4bb5800093eafdece13874d1c49bc87e111" 17592186348675 "q-1406/selection/d3c7dfa939cfd7899d56e3e89defbd89a48020450968061b4a2230f3af7c9f9a" 17592186348676 "q-282262/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" 17592186348677 "q-282276" 17592186348678 "q-282276/field-1" 17592186348679 "q-282276/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7